  "prefLabel": "Phy 302.13 Test of English as a Foreign Language (TOEFL)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Phy 302.13 “Test of English as a Foreign Language (TOEFL)” means a test developed by the Educational Testing Service to measure the ability of non-native speakers of English to use and understand English as it is spoken, written, and heard in college and university settings.\n\nSource. #9233, eff 8-22-08; ss by #10933, eff 9-18-15; ss by #12864, eff 9-10-19; ss by #14563, eff 6-20-26, EXPIRES: 6-20-36",
